{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>בי.</b> Is language of request, and in my opinion it is an abbreviated form, like בי אני אדני העון (1 Samuel 25:24), and the meaning of עון in this place is like the meaning of \"גדול עוני מנשוא\" (Genesis 4:13), and the sense is: do with me as you wish and hear me:"], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 43, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:47:54.187704990Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}